<h1>See room climate in section.</h1>

<p class="lead">RoomXDynamics is a simulation for iPhone. It shows a slice through a room with an outside wall and a window: how warm and cool air move through the room and how cool the wall surface gets. Everything happens in the model. The results are trends, not values for your room.</p>

